  "question_text": "Three individuals A, B, C start a company and contribute a total of Rs.P towards its running.\ncontributions of A, B and C are in the ratio 8:7:6, then P (in rupees) is\nA, B, C PB\nA 50,000 C B 50,000\nA, B, C 8:7:6 P ",
